Server init.

>> x := Blob nĳ: 65 type: ['char'].
# for this test you need set a path to libc (puts)
>> libname := Programma ynstelling: ['FFITESTLIB'].
Server keppelje: (
 Rige nĳ ;
 libname ;
 ['putchar'] ;
 ( Rige nĳ ; ['char'] ) ;
 ['void'] ;
 ['Print'] ;
 ['char:']
).
Print char: (x fan: 0 lingte: 1), nije-rigel.
x frijjaan.

